r resection margin and roughly 1 2cm from the anterior resection margin  The nodule is hard with tan  homogeneous cut surface  The rest of the breast tissue shows diffuse fibrocystic change most prominent at the lateral aspect of the specimen  No lymph nodes identified  The biopsy cavity is submitted representatively as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The nodule is submitted entirely as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Two representative sections of the uninvolved breast are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   An additional section of the biopsy cavity is submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Aleksandr Vasilyev M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Aleksandr Vasilyev M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Dennis Sgroi M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
