ry  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  10 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 13 41 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast tissue short stitch anterior  long stitch lateral  and bowtie cephalad   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 4cm portion of tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with three black stitches designating the anterolateral and cephalad margins  The superior margin is inked black  the inferior blue  the anterior orange and the posterior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm hemorrhagic focus within the specimen  consistent with previous biopsy site  which comes to 1 2cm of the anterior  1 5cm of the superior  3 0cm of the posterior  1 8cm of the inferior  and  5 0cm of the medial and lateral margins  Surrounding the hemorrhagic focus is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm region of yellow chalky fat necrosis  which comes to within 1 1cm of the closest inferior margin  The fibrous tissue surrounding the hemorrhagic focus is firm  diffusely nodular and diffusely cystic gray white fibrous tissue  which comes to 0 7cm of the posterior  0 8cm of the inferior  1 4cm of the superior  1 4cm of the anterior  and  5 0cm of the medial margin  This nodular fibrous tissue focally abuts the lateral margin  The remaining cut surface is 70  tan yellow adipose and 30  gray white focally cystic fibrous tissue  representative sections are submitted from medial to lateral as A N  with the medial margin radially sectioned as A  the cavity as F I  the focus of fat necrosis as J  and the lateral margin radially sectioned as N  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  JOHN BRANDA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin Hughes MD P