es  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  2  RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Left  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    TISSUE INSUFFICIENT FOR EVALUATION   SEE NOTE   NOTE  HER 2 FISH was performed twice and did not yield any Her 2 or Chromosome 17 signals on both occasions  Tissue is insufficiently preserved for Her 2 FISH evaluation  Addendum  2 by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH 16   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 03 59 34PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left   Biopsy PART B  Breast  Left   Excision PART C  Lymph Node  Left   Sentinel    Excision PART D  Breast  Left Anterior  Margin   Excision PART E  Breast  Left Posterior  Margin   Excision PART F  Breast  Left Superior  Margin   Excision PART G  Lymph Nodes  Left Axillary Contents   Dissect  report_end  , Unchecked.
